  "description": "Gated 64-episode Hybrid-NMCC pilot for State College with 2,500 individual evacuees. One eight-episode rollout pretrains the action-independent natural model, one pretrains the causal residual ensemble, two warm up the recurrent controller, and four jointly optimize the controller with the exact local causal signal reduced to 0.35 so full-tail global GAE contributes to the final policy.",
